<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns four secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns four secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed four credit auctions in the secondary market whereby it sought to inject 7.348 billion pesos.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM    AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>1.924  bln pesos  9 days  30.91 pct</p>
<p>1.924  bln pesos  7 days  30.87 pct</p>
<p>2.000  bln pesos  6 days  30.77 pct</p>
<p>    1.500  bln pesos  1 day   30.88 pct</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500))</p>
</text>
